{"id": null, "n": "0343013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0343013", "type": "orig", "text": "劇＝處【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0343014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0343014", "type": "orig", "text": "皆＝不【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0343015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0343015", "type": "orig", "text": "如行＝行何如【元】【明】"}
